      "id": "yeats-collected-poems-s0409-p00854",
      "source_en": "In the passage about the Swan in Part III I have unconsciously echoed one\nof the loveliest lyrics of our time - Mr. Sturge Moore's 'Dying Swan.' I often\nrecited it during an American lecturing tour, which explains the theft.",
